   "html": "<section class=\"c-cover-split\">\n  <div class=\"field\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <i class=\"dots\"></i>\n    <i class=\"sun\"></i>\n    <i class=\"arch\"></i>\n    <i class=\"block\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\"></i>\n    <i class=\"quarter\"></i>\n    <i class=\"bar\"></i>\n    <i class=\"pip\"></i>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"body\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Annual planning</span>\n    <div class=\"main\">\n      <h1>Build the year around fewer, bigger bets</h1>\n      <p class=\"sub\">A working session to pick the three priorities that earn the budget, and say no to the rest.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\"><span><b>Amara Okafor</b>, Head of Strategy</span><span>31 October 2026</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-cover-split {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 41cqi minmax(0, 1fr);\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-cover-split .field {\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-highlight-fill);\n}\n.c-cover-split .field > * { position: absolute; display: block; }\n.c-cover-split .dots {\n  left: 3cqi;\n  top: 3cqi;\n  width: 13cqi;\n  height: 13cqi;\n  background-image: radial-gradient(circle, var(--ds-ink) 0.18cqi, transparent 0.24cqi);\n  background-size: 1.9cqi 1.9cqi;\n  opacity: 0.35;\n}\n.c-cover-split .sun {\n  left: 14cqi;\n  top: 7cqi;\n  width: 21cqi;\n  height: 21cqi;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--ds-series-2);\n}\n.c-cover-split .arch {\n  left: 5cqi;\n  bottom: 5cqi;\n  width: 16cqi;\n  height: 22.2cqi;\n  border-radius: 16cqi 16cqi 0 0;\n  background: var(--ds-series-1);\n}\n.c-cover-split .quarter {\n  left: 21cqi;\n  bottom: 0;\n  width: 16cqi;\n  height: 16cqi;\n  border-radius: 100% 0 0 0;\n  background: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-cover-split .block {\n  left: 21cqi;\n  top: 29cqi;\n  width: 9cqi;\n  height: 9cqi;\n  background: var(--ds-series-3);\n}\n.c-cover-split .ring {\n  left: 30cqi;\n  top: 29cqi;\n  width: 7cqi;\n  height: 7cqi;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  border: 0.5cqi solid var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-cover-split .bar {\n  left: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  width: 21cqi;\n  height: 5cqi;\n  background: var(--ds-series-5);\n}\n.c-cover-split .pip {\n  left: 2cqi;\n  top: 24cqi;\n  width: 2.2cqi;\n  height: 2.2cqi;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-cover-split .body {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;\n  padding: 6cqi 7cqi 5cqi 6cqi;\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n.c-cover-split .tag {\n  justify-self: start;\n  padding: 0.55cqi 1.5cqi;\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill);\n  background: var(--ds-highlight-fill);\n  border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-highlight-line);\n  font-size: 1.3cqi;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-cover-split .main { align-self: center; display: grid; gap: 2.2cqi; }\n.c-cover-split h1 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 5.4cqi;\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1.04;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-cover-split .sub { margin: 0; max-width: 40cqi; font-size: 1.9cqi; line-height: 1.45; }\n.c-cover-split .foot {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 2cqi;\n  padding-top: 1.8cqi;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  font-size: 1.3cqi;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n}\n.c-cover-split .foot b { color: var(--ds-text); font-weight: 600; }",
   "js": ""
