   "html": "<section class=\"c-governing-question\" aria-label=\"Governing question\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"top\"><p class=\"kicker\">Governing question</p></div>\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      <div class=\"stage\">\n        <h1>How should we grow regional parcel revenue to EUR 450m by 2029 without giving up margin?</h1>\n        <div class=\"rule\"><span>Three sub-questions this deck answers</span></div>\n        <ol class=\"subs\">\n        <li><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"t\">Where is the growth: which customers and regions should we win?</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"n\">2</span><span class=\"t\">What must change in the network to serve that demand profitably?</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"n\">3</span><span class=\"t\">What will it cost, and how should we sequence the investment?</span></li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\"><span>Source: Steering committee brief, October 2026.</span><span class=\"page\">3</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-governing-question {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-governing-question .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n  padding: 5cqi 6cqi 3.2cqi;\n}\n.c-governing-question .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 3cqi; }\n.c-governing-question .kicker { margin: 0; font-size: 1.25cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-governing-question h1 {\n  margin: 1cqi 0 0;\n  max-width: 78cqi;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 2.6cqi;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  text-wrap: balance;\n}\n.c-governing-question .tracker { position: absolute; top: 5cqi; right: 6cqi; display: flex; gap: 0.5cqi; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n.c-governing-question .tracker li {\n  padding: 0.3cqi 0.9cqi;\n  border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill);\n  font-size: 1cqi;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.c-governing-question .tracker li.on { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border-color: var(--ds-highlight-line); color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-governing-question .body { min-height: 0; padding: 2.4cqi 0 2cqi; }\n.c-governing-question .foot {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 3cqi;\n  padding-top: 0.9cqi;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  font-size: 0.95cqi;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n}\n.c-governing-question .page { flex: none; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-governing-question .body { display: grid; align-items: center; padding-top: 0; }\n.c-governing-question .stage { display: grid; justify-items: center; gap: 3.4cqi; text-align: center; }\n.c-governing-question h1 { margin: 0; max-width: 70cqi; font-size: 4.2cqi; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.18; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }\n.c-governing-question .rule { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.6cqi; width: 100%; font-size: 1.15cqi; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-governing-question .rule::before, .c-governing-question .rule::after { content: \"\"; flex: 1; height: 0; border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); }\n.c-governing-question .subs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 2cqi; width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; text-align: left; }\n.c-governing-question .subs li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1.4cqi; padding: 1.8cqi 2cqi; background: var(--ds-raised); border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); border-radius: calc(0.6cqi * var(--ds-radius-scale, 1)); }\n.c-governing-question .n { flex: none; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 3cqi; height: 3cqi; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-highlight-line); font-size: 1.5cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-governing-question .t { font-size: 1.6cqi; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-ink); padding-top: 0.2cqi; }",
