   "html": "<section class=\"c-issue-tree\" aria-label=\"Issue tree: key question, three branches, seven sub-issues\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"top\">\n      <div class=\"hd\">\n        <p class=\"kicker\">Problem structure</p>\n        <h1>Network capacity is the branch to resolve first, because it gates both growth and cost</h1>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      <div class=\"tree\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 880 324\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"ln\" d=\"M190 162H230M230 42V282M230 42H260M480 42H520M520 18V66M520 18H560M520 66H560M230 282H260M480 282H520M520 258V306M520 258H560M520 306H560\"/><path class=\"ln is-pri\" d=\"M230 162H260M480 162H520M520 114V210M520 114H560M520 162H560M520 210H560\"/></svg>\n      <div class=\"node root\" style=\"left:0;top:10.70cqi;width:19cqi;height:11cqi\"><span class=\"lbl\">Key question</span>How do we reach EUR 450m revenue by 2029 at a 14% margin?</div>\n      <div class=\"node branch\" style=\"left:26cqi;top:0.70cqi;width:22cqi;height:7cqi\">Grow demand</div>\n      <div class=\"node leaf\" style=\"left:56cqi;top:0.00cqi;width:32cqi;height:3.6cqi\"><b>1.1</b><span>Win share in e-commerce parcels</span></div>\n      <div class=\"node leaf\" style=\"left:56cqi;top:4.80cqi;width:32cqi;height:3.6cqi\"><b>1.2</b><span>Enter two adjacent regions</span></div>\n      <div class=\"node branch is-pri\" style=\"left:26cqi;top:12.70cqi;width:22cqi;height:7cqi\"><span class=\"flag\">Priority</span>Fix network capacity</div>\n      <div class=\"node leaf is-pri\" style=\"left:56cqi;top:9.60cqi;width:32cqi;height:3.6cqi\"><b>2.1</b><span>Add automated sortation hubs</span></div>\n      <div class=\"node leaf is-pri\" style=\"left:56cqi;top:14.40cqi;width:32cqi;height:3.6cqi\"><b>2.2</b><span>Refresh the six busiest depots</span></div>\n      <div class=\"node leaf is-pri\" style=\"left:56cqi;top:19.20cqi;width:32cqi;height:3.6cqi\"><b>2.3</b><span>Rebalance routes across depots</span></div>\n      <div class=\"node branch\" style=\"left:26cqi;top:24.70cqi;width:22cqi;height:7cqi\">Lower unit cost</div>\n      <div class=\"node leaf\" style=\"left:56cqi;top:24.00cqi;width:32cqi;height:3.6cqi\"><b>3.1</b><span>Cut last-mile cost per drop</span></div>\n      <div class=\"node leaf\" style=\"left:56cqi;top:28.80cqi;width:32cqi;height:3.6cqi\"><b>3.2</b><span>Renegotiate fleet and fuel contracts</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\"><span>Source: Strategy workshop with the executive team, October 2026.</span><span class=\"page\">4</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-issue-tree {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-issue-tree .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n  padding: 5cqi 6cqi 3.2cqi;\n}\n.c-issue-tree .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 3cqi; }\n.c-issue-tree .kicker { margin: 0; font-size: 1.25cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-issue-tree h1 {\n  margin: 1cqi 0 0;\n  max-width: 78cqi;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 2.6cqi;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  text-wrap: balance;\n}\n.c-issue-tree .tracker { position: absolute; top: 5cqi; right: 6cqi; display: flex; gap: 0.5cqi; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n.c-issue-tree .tracker li {\n  padding: 0.3cqi 0.9cqi;\n  border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill);\n  font-size: 1cqi;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.c-issue-tree .tracker li.on { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border-color: var(--ds-highlight-line); color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-issue-tree .body { min-height: 0; padding: 2.4cqi 0 2cqi; }\n.c-issue-tree .foot {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 3cqi;\n  padding-top: 0.9cqi;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  font-size: 0.95cqi;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n}\n.c-issue-tree .page { flex: none; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-issue-tree .body { padding-top: 1.6cqi; }\n.c-issue-tree .tree { position: relative; width: 88cqi; height: 32.4cqi; }\n.c-issue-tree .tree svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible; }\n.c-issue-tree .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--ds-neutral-line); stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-linecap: square; }\n.c-issue-tree .ln.is-pri { stroke: var(--ds-highlight-line); stroke-width: 2.4; }\n.c-issue-tree .node { position: absolute; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; align-items: center; background: var(--ds-raised); border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); border-radius: calc(0.6cqi * var(--ds-radius-scale, 1)); color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-issue-tree .root { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5cqi; padding: 0 1.6cqi; background: var(--ds-action); border-color: var(--ds-action); color: var(--ds-on-action); font-size: 1.55cqi; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; }\n.c-issue-tree .lbl { font-size: 1cqi; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.7; }\n.c-issue-tree .branch { padding: 0 1.6cqi; font-size: 1.7cqi; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; }\n.c-issue-tree .branch.is-pri { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-highlight-line); }\n.c-issue-tree .flag { position: absolute; top: -0.9cqi; left: 1.2cqi; padding: 0.2cqi 0.8cqi; border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill); background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-highlight-line); font-size: 0.95cqi; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-issue-tree .leaf { gap: 1cqi; padding: 0 1.4cqi; font-size: 1.4cqi; line-height: 1.2; }\n.c-issue-tree .leaf b { flex: none; font-size: 1.15cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-issue-tree .leaf.is-pri { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-highlight-line) 60%, transparent); }",
