   "html": "<section class=\"c-keynote-shortcuts\" aria-label=\"Five Orbit 2 keyboard shortcuts\">\n  <div class=\"sky\"></div>\n  <div class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow rv\" style=\"--d:0\">Keyboard</p>\n    <h2 class=\"display rv\" style=\"--d:1\">Everything<br>is a <span class=\"grad\">keystroke.</span></h2>\n    <p class=\"sub rv\" style=\"--d:2\">Forty new shortcuts, all of them remappable.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"panel rv\" style=\"--d:1\">\n    <div class=\"row on\"><span class=\"keys\"><kbd class=\"key\">&#8984;</kbd><kbd class=\"key\">K</kbd></span><span class=\"desc\">Jump anywhere<span>Search people, spaces and commands</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"keys\"><kbd class=\"key\">&#8984;</kbd><kbd class=\"key\">&#8679;</kbd><kbd class=\"key\">N</kbd></span><span class=\"desc\">New space<span>Start from a template or blank</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"keys\"><kbd class=\"key\">&#8997;</kbd><kbd class=\"key\">&#8629;</kbd></span><span class=\"desc\">Reply in thread<span>Keep the main channel quiet</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"keys\"><kbd class=\"key\">&#8984;</kbd><kbd class=\"key\">.</kbd></span><span class=\"desc\">Start a huddle<span>Voice room, one keystroke</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"keys\"><kbd class=\"key\">&#8984;</kbd><kbd class=\"key\">&#8679;</kbd><kbd class=\"key\">L</kbd></span><span class=\"desc\">Share a live link<span>Anyone can follow along</span></span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-keynote-shortcuts, .c-keynote-shortcuts *, .c-keynote-shortcuts *::before, .c-keynote-shortcuts *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.c-keynote-shortcuts {\n  --k-bg: var(--ds-ink);\n  --k-fg: var(--ds-bg);\n  --k-dim: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-bg) 60%, var(--ds-ink));\n  --k-soft: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-bg) 82%, var(--ds-ink));\n  --k-line: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-bg) 16%, transparent);\n  --k-card: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-bg) 7%, var(--ds-ink));\n  --k-card-2: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-bg) 12%, var(--ds-ink));\n  --k-blue: var(--ds-info-line);\n  --k-amber: var(--ds-highlight-line);\n  --k-green: var(--ds-note-line);\n  --k-t1: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-info-line) 80%, var(--ds-bg));\n  --k-t2: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-highlight-line) 80%, var(--ds-bg));\n  --k-t3: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-note-line) 80%, var(--ds-bg));\n  --k-s1: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-info-line) 66%, var(--ds-bg));\n  --k-s2: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-highlight-line) 66%, var(--ds-bg));\n  --k-s3: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-note-line) 66%, var(--ds-bg));\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--k-bg);\n  color: var(--k-fg);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n.c-keynote-shortcuts .sky {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(70% 60% at 50% 118%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-blue) 24%, transparent), transparent 70%),\n    radial-gradient(50% 45% at 94% -8%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-amber) 14%, transparent), transparent 70%),\n    radial-gradient(45% 40% at 2% 30%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-green) 8%, transparent), transparent 70%);\n}\n.c-keynote-shortcuts .pad { position: absolute; inset: 0; padding: 5.5cqi 7cqi; }\n.c-keynote-shortcuts .eyebrow { margin: 0; font-size: 1.3cqi; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--k-dim); }\n.c-keynote-shortcuts .display {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1.02;\n  color: var(--k-fg);\n}\n.c-keynote-shortcuts .grad {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 0 0.04em 0.1em 0;\n  margin: 0 -0.04em -0.1em 0;\n  background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--k-t1) 0%, var(--k-t3) 52%, var(--k-t2) 100%);\n  -webkit-background-clip: text;\n  background-clip: text;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n}\n.c-keynote-shortcuts.is-armed .rv { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(1.8cqi); }\n.c-keynote-shortcuts.is-armed.is-in .rv {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: none;\n  transition: opacity var(--ds-dur-slow) var(--ds-ease), transform var(--ds-dur-slow) var(--ds-ease);\n  transition-delay: calc(var(--d, 0) * 110ms);\n}\n  .c-keynote-shortcuts .sky {\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(44% 70% at 74% 50%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-blue) 18%, transparent), transparent 70%),\n      radial-gradient(34% 40% at 0% 100%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-green) 10%, transparent), transparent 70%),\n      radial-gradient(34% 40% at 100% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-amber) 12%, transparent), transparent 70%);\n  }\n  .c-keynote-shortcuts .intro { position: absolute; left: 7cqi; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 34cqi; display: grid; align-content: center; gap: 2cqi; }\n  .c-keynote-shortcuts h2 { font-size: 5.4cqi; line-height: 1.04; }\n  .c-keynote-shortcuts .sub { margin: 0; font-size: 1.8cqi; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--k-dim); }\n  .c-keynote-shortcuts .panel {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 46cqi;\n    right: 7cqi;\n    top: 7cqi;\n    bottom: 7cqi;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-rows: repeat(5, 1fr);\n    padding: 0.6cqi 2.4cqi;\n    border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--k-line);\n    border-radius: calc(2cqi * var(--ds-radius-scale, 1));\n    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--k-card-2), var(--k-card));\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8cqi color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-blue) 16%, transparent);\n  }\n  .c-keynote-shortcuts .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 17cqi minmax(0, 1fr); align-items: center; gap: 1.6cqi; border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--k-line); }\n  .c-keynote-shortcuts .row:first-child { border-top: 0; }\n  .c-keynote-shortcuts .keys { display: flex; gap: 0.7cqi; }\n  .c-keynote-shortcuts .key {\n    display: inline-grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    min-width: 4.4cqi;\n    height: 4.4cqi;\n    padding: 0 1cqi;\n    border: var(--ds-hairline) solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-fg) 22%, transparent);\n    border-bottom: 0.45cqi solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-fg) 22%, var(--k-card));\n    border-radius: calc(1cqi * var(--ds-radius-scale, 1));\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-fg) 16%, var(--k-card)), var(--k-card-2));\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0.1cqi 0 color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-fg) 24%, transparent), 0 0.6cqi 1.4cqi color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-bg) 70%, transparent);\n    font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n    font-size: 2cqi;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1;\n    color: var(--k-fg);\n  }\n  .c-keynote-shortcuts .row.on .key { box-shadow: inset 0 0.1cqi 0 color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-fg) 24%, transparent), 0 0 2.4cqi color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-blue) 55%, transparent); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-blue) 70%, transparent); }\n  .c-keynote-shortcuts .desc { font-size: 2.2cqi; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--k-fg); }\n  .c-keynote-shortcuts .desc span { display: block; margin-top: 0.3cqi; font-size: 1.25cqi; font-weight: 500; color: var(--k-dim); }",
   "js": "(() => {\n  const reduced = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  document.querySelectorAll('.c-keynote-shortcuts').forEach((root) => {\n    if (root.dataset.okInit) return;\n    root.dataset.okInit = '1';\n    if (reduced) return;\n    root.classList.add('is-armed');\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      if (!entries.some((e) => e.isIntersecting)) return;\n      io.disconnect();\n      requestAnimationFrame(() => requestAnimationFrame(() => root.classList.add('is-in')));\n    }, { threshold: 0.35 });\n    io.observe(root);\n  });\n})();"
