   "html": "<section class=\"c-keynote-statement\" aria-label=\"Everything moves together\">\n  <div class=\"sky\"></div>\n  <div class=\"horizon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  <div class=\"brand\"><span class=\"mark\"></span>Orbit 2</div>\n  <div class=\"center\">\n    <h2 class=\"display rv\" style=\"--d:0\">Everything moves<br><span class=\"grad\">together.</span></h2>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-keynote-statement, .c-keynote-statement *, .c-keynote-statement *::before, .c-keynote-statement *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.c-keynote-statement {\n  --k-bg: var(--ds-ink);\n  --k-fg: var(--ds-bg);\n  --k-dim: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-bg) 60%, var(--ds-ink));\n  --k-soft: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-bg) 82%, var(--ds-ink));\n  --k-line: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-bg) 16%, transparent);\n  --k-card: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-bg) 7%, var(--ds-ink));\n  --k-card-2: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-bg) 12%, var(--ds-ink));\n  --k-blue: var(--ds-info-line);\n  --k-amber: var(--ds-highlight-line);\n  --k-green: var(--ds-note-line);\n  --k-t1: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-info-line) 80%, var(--ds-bg));\n  --k-t2: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-highlight-line) 80%, var(--ds-bg));\n  --k-t3: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-note-line) 80%, var(--ds-bg));\n  --k-s1: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-info-line) 66%, var(--ds-bg));\n  --k-s2: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-highlight-line) 66%, var(--ds-bg));\n  --k-s3: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-note-line) 66%, var(--ds-bg));\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--k-bg);\n  color: var(--k-fg);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n.c-keynote-statement .sky {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(70% 60% at 50% 118%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-blue) 24%, transparent), transparent 70%),\n    radial-gradient(50% 45% at 94% -8%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-amber) 14%, transparent), transparent 70%),\n    radial-gradient(45% 40% at 2% 30%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-green) 8%, transparent), transparent 70%);\n}\n.c-keynote-statement .pad { position: absolute; inset: 0; padding: 5.5cqi 7cqi; }\n.c-keynote-statement .eyebrow { margin: 0; font-size: 1.3cqi; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--k-dim); }\n.c-keynote-statement .display {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1.02;\n  color: var(--k-fg);\n}\n.c-keynote-statement .grad {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 0 0.04em 0.1em 0;\n  margin: 0 -0.04em -0.1em 0;\n  background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--k-t1) 0%, var(--k-t3) 52%, var(--k-t2) 100%);\n  -webkit-background-clip: text;\n  background-clip: text;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n}\n.c-keynote-statement.is-armed .rv { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(1.8cqi); }\n.c-keynote-statement.is-armed.is-in .rv {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: none;\n  transition: opacity var(--ds-dur-slow) var(--ds-ease), transform var(--ds-dur-slow) var(--ds-ease);\n  transition-delay: calc(var(--d, 0) * 110ms);\n}\n  .c-keynote-statement .sky {\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(34% 36% at 58% 54%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-green) 14%, transparent), transparent 72%),\n      radial-gradient(40% 40% at 36% 42%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-blue) 16%, transparent), transparent 72%),\n      radial-gradient(40% 40% at 74% 40%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-amber) 12%, transparent), transparent 72%);\n  }\n  .c-keynote-statement .horizon {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -36cqi;\n    right: -36cqi;\n    top: 50cqi;\n    height: 100cqi;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border-top: 0.12cqi solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-t1) 85%, transparent);\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(52% 36% at 50% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-blue) 34%, transparent), transparent 72%),\n      var(--k-bg);\n    box-shadow: 0 -1.2cqi 7cqi color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-blue) 40%, transparent), 0 -0.3cqi 1.6cqi color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-t1) 40%, transparent);\n  }\n  .c-keynote-statement .brand { position: absolute; left: 7cqi; top: 5.5cqi; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1cqi; font-size: 1.8cqi; font-weight: 700; }\n  .c-keynote-statement .brand .mark { position: relative; width: 2.3cqi; height: 2.3cqi; border-radius: 50%; border: 0.24cqi solid var(--k-fg); }\n  .c-keynote-statement .brand .mark::after { content: \"\"; position: absolute; right: -0.55cqi; top: -0.2cqi; width: 0.7cqi; height: 0.7cqi; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--k-amber); }\n  .c-keynote-statement .center { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 0 7cqi 5cqi; text-align: center; }\n  .c-keynote-statement h2 { font-size: 9.6cqi; line-height: 1.02; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .c-keynote-statement h2 .grad { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 3.4cqi color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-blue) 55%, transparent)); }",
