   "html": "<section class=\"c-keynote-whats-new\" aria-label=\"Six updates in Orbit 2\">\n  <div class=\"sky\"></div>\n  <h2 class=\"display title rv\" style=\"--d:0\">What's <span class=\"grad\">new.</span></h2>\n  <div class=\"list\">\n    <div class=\"item rv\" style=\"--d:1\"><span class=\"ver\">v2.0.0</span><h3>Live canvas</h3><p>Think together on one infinite board.</p><span class=\"pill new\">New</span></div>\n    <div class=\"item rv\" style=\"--d:2\"><span class=\"ver\">v2.0.0</span><h3>Thread summaries</h3><p>Every long thread gets a short recap.</p><span class=\"pill new\">New</span></div>\n    <div class=\"item rv\" style=\"--d:3\"><span class=\"ver\">v2.0.0</span><h3>Offline mode</h3><p>Edit anywhere, sync when you are back.</p><span class=\"pill new\">New</span></div>\n    <div class=\"item rv\" style=\"--d:4\"><span class=\"ver\">v1.9.8</span><h3>Instant search</h3><p>Results appear as you type.</p><span class=\"pill fast\">Faster</span></div>\n    <div class=\"item rv\" style=\"--d:5\"><span class=\"ver\">v1.9.5</span><h3>Voice rooms</h3><p>Join a call in one click.</p><span class=\"pill better\">Improved</span></div>\n    <div class=\"item rv\" style=\"--d:6\"><span class=\"ver\">v1.9.2</span><h3>Keyboard shortcuts</h3><p>Forty new shortcuts, all remappable.</p><span class=\"pill better\">Improved</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-keynote-whats-new, .c-keynote-whats-new *, .c-keynote-whats-new *::before, .c-keynote-whats-new *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.c-keynote-whats-new {\n  --k-bg: var(--ds-ink);\n  --k-fg: var(--ds-bg);\n  --k-dim: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-bg) 60%, var(--ds-ink));\n  --k-soft: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-bg) 82%, var(--ds-ink));\n  --k-line: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-bg) 16%, transparent);\n  --k-card: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-bg) 7%, var(--ds-ink));\n  --k-card-2: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-bg) 12%, var(--ds-ink));\n  --k-blue: var(--ds-info-line);\n  --k-amber: var(--ds-highlight-line);\n  --k-green: var(--ds-note-line);\n  --k-t1: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-info-line) 80%, var(--ds-bg));\n  --k-t2: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-highlight-line) 80%, var(--ds-bg));\n  --k-t3: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-note-line) 80%, var(--ds-bg));\n  --k-s1: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-info-line) 66%, var(--ds-bg));\n  --k-s2: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-highlight-line) 66%, var(--ds-bg));\n  --k-s3: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-note-line) 66%, var(--ds-bg));\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--k-bg);\n  color: var(--k-fg);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n.c-keynote-whats-new .sky {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(70% 60% at 50% 118%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-blue) 24%, transparent), transparent 70%),\n    radial-gradient(50% 45% at 94% -8%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-amber) 14%, transparent), transparent 70%),\n    radial-gradient(45% 40% at 2% 30%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-green) 8%, transparent), transparent 70%);\n}\n.c-keynote-whats-new .pad { position: absolute; inset: 0; padding: 5.5cqi 7cqi; }\n.c-keynote-whats-new .eyebrow { margin: 0; font-size: 1.3cqi; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--k-dim); }\n.c-keynote-whats-new .display {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1.02;\n  color: var(--k-fg);\n}\n.c-keynote-whats-new .grad {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 0 0.04em 0.1em 0;\n  margin: 0 -0.04em -0.1em 0;\n  background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--k-t1) 0%, var(--k-t3) 52%, var(--k-t2) 100%);\n  -webkit-background-clip: text;\n  background-clip: text;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n}\n.c-keynote-whats-new.is-armed .rv { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(1.8cqi); }\n.c-keynote-whats-new.is-armed.is-in .rv {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: none;\n  transition: opacity var(--ds-dur-slow) var(--ds-ease), transform var(--ds-dur-slow) var(--ds-ease);\n  transition-delay: calc(var(--d, 0) * 110ms);\n}\n  .c-keynote-whats-new .sky {\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(50% 50% at 18% 6%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-blue) 20%, transparent), transparent 70%),\n      radial-gradient(44% 44% at 100% 100%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-amber) 14%, transparent), transparent 70%),\n      radial-gradient(40% 40% at 0% 100%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-green) 10%, transparent), transparent 70%);\n  }\n  .c-keynote-whats-new .title { position: absolute; left: 7cqi; top: 5.4cqi; font-size: 5cqi; }\n  .c-keynote-whats-new .list { position: absolute; left: 7cqi; right: 7cqi; top: 17.2cqi; display: grid; border-bottom: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--k-line); }\n  .c-keynote-whats-new .item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 10cqi 25cqi minmax(0, 1fr) 9.5cqi; align-items: center; gap: 1.6cqi; height: 5.7cqi; border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--k-line); }\n  .c-keynote-whats-new .ver { justify-self: start; padding: 0.4cqi 1cqi; border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--k-line); border-radius: calc(0.7cqi * var(--ds-radius-scale, 1)); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--k-fg) 6%, transparent); font-family: var(--ds-font-mono); font-size: 1.3cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--k-soft); }\n  .c-keynote-whats-new .item h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 2.1cqi; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--k-fg); white-space: nowrap; }\n  .c-keynote-whats-new .item p { margin: 0; font-size: 1.6cqi; color: var(--k-dim); }\n  .c-keynote-whats-new .pill { justify-self: end; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6cqi; padding: 0.45cqi 1.2cqi 0.45cqi 1cqi; border: var(--ds-hairline) solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--tint) 60%, transparent); border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tint) 14%, transparent); font-size: 1.2cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--k-fg); }\n  .c-keynote-whats-new .pill::before { content: \"\"; width: 0.7cqi; height: 0.7cqi; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--tint); }\n  .c-keynote-whats-new .pill.new { --tint: var(--k-blue); }\n  .c-keynote-whats-new .pill.fast { --tint: var(--k-green); }\n  .c-keynote-whats-new .pill.better { --tint: var(--k-amber); }",
   "js": "(() => {\n  const reduced = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  document.querySelectorAll('.c-keynote-whats-new').forEach((root) => {\n    if (root.dataset.okInit) return;\n    root.dataset.okInit = '1';\n    if (reduced) return;\n    root.classList.add('is-armed');\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      if (!entries.some((e) => e.isIntersecting)) return;\n      io.disconnect();\n      requestAnimationFrame(() => requestAnimationFrame(() => root.classList.add('is-in')));\n    }, { threshold: 0.35 });\n    io.observe(root);\n  });\n})();"
