   "html": "<section class=\"c-options-evaluation\" aria-label=\"Weighted scoring of three options\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"top\">\n      <div class=\"hd\">\n        <p class=\"kicker\">Options</p>\n        <h1>The hub-and-spoke network scores 3.75 of 5, ahead of both alternatives on a weighted basis</h1>\n      </div>\n      <ol class=\"tracker\" aria-label=\"Deck sections\"><li>Context</li><li class=\"on\" aria-current=\"step\">Options</li><li>Recommendation</li><li>Next steps</li></ol>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      <div class=\"grid\">\n      <div class=\"head lbl\">Criterion</div><div class=\"head lbl c2\">Weight</div>\n      <div class=\"head\"><small>Option A</small>Upgrade existing<br>depots</div>\n      <div class=\"head rec\"><span class=\"tag\">Recommended</span><small>Option B</small>Hub-and-spoke<br>network</div>\n      <div class=\"head\"><small>Option C</small>Acquire a<br>regional rival</div>\n      <div class=\"crit\">Revenue potential</div><div class=\"w\">30%</div><div class=\"s\">2</div><div class=\"s rec\">4</div><div class=\"s\">5</div>\n      <div class=\"crit\">Capital required</div><div class=\"w\">20%</div><div class=\"s\">4</div><div class=\"s rec\">3</div><div class=\"s\">1</div>\n      <div class=\"crit\">Delivery risk</div><div class=\"w\">20%</div><div class=\"s\">4</div><div class=\"s rec\">3</div><div class=\"s\">2</div>\n      <div class=\"crit\">Time to impact</div><div class=\"w\">15%</div><div class=\"s\">3</div><div class=\"s rec\">4</div><div class=\"s\">2</div>\n      <div class=\"crit\">Strategic fit</div><div class=\"w\">15%</div><div class=\"s\">2</div><div class=\"s rec\">5</div><div class=\"s\">3</div>\n      <div class=\"tot lab\">Weighted total</div><div class=\"tot wt\">100%</div><div class=\"tot\">2.95</div><div class=\"tot rec\">3.75</div><div class=\"tot\">2.85</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\"><span>Source: Steering committee scoring workshop, October 2026. Scores 1 (weak) to 5 (strong); for capital and risk, 5 is best.</span><span class=\"page\">8</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-options-evaluation {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-options-evaluation .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n  padding: 5cqi 6cqi 3.2cqi;\n}\n.c-options-evaluation .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 3cqi; }\n.c-options-evaluation .kicker { margin: 0; font-size: 1.25cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-options-evaluation h1 {\n  margin: 1cqi 0 0;\n  max-width: 78cqi;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 2.6cqi;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  text-wrap: balance;\n}\n.c-options-evaluation .tracker { position: absolute; top: 5cqi; right: 6cqi; display: flex; gap: 0.5cqi; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n.c-options-evaluation .tracker li {\n  padding: 0.3cqi 0.9cqi;\n  border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill);\n  font-size: 1cqi;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.c-options-evaluation .tracker li.on { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border-color: var(--ds-highlight-line); color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-options-evaluation .body { min-height: 0; padding: 2.4cqi 0 2cqi; }\n.c-options-evaluation .foot {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 3cqi;\n  padding-top: 0.9cqi;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  font-size: 0.95cqi;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n}\n.c-options-evaluation .page { flex: none; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-options-evaluation .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22cqi 9cqi repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); grid-template-rows: auto repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)) minmax(0, 1.25fr); height: 100%; }\n.c-options-evaluation .grid > div { display: flex; align-items: center; border-bottom: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); }\n.c-options-evaluation .crit { font-size: 1.6cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-options-evaluation .w { justify-content: center; font-size: 1.4cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-options-evaluation .s { justify-content: center; font-size: 2cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-options-evaluation .head { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 0.4cqi; padding-bottom: 1.2cqi; text-align: center; font-size: 1.7cqi; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-options-evaluation .head small { font-size: 1.15cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-options-evaluation .head.lbl { align-items: flex-start; justify-content: flex-end; font-size: 1.1cqi; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-options-evaluation .head.lbl.c2 { align-items: center; }\n.c-options-evaluation .tag { padding: 0.3cqi 1cqi; border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill); background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-highlight-line); font-size: 1cqi; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-options-evaluation .rec { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border-left: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-highlight-line); border-right: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-highlight-line); border-bottom-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-highlight-line) 40%, transparent); }\n.c-options-evaluation .head.rec { border-top: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-highlight-line); border-radius: calc(0.6cqi * var(--ds-radius-scale, 1)) calc(0.6cqi * var(--ds-radius-scale, 1)) 0 0; }\n.c-options-evaluation .tot { border-top: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-ink); border-bottom-color: transparent !important; font-size: 2.6cqi; font-weight: 800; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-options-evaluation .tot.lab { font-size: 1.6cqi; justify-content: flex-start; }\n.c-options-evaluation .tot.wt { font-size: 1.2cqi; color: var(--ds-muted); justify-content: center; }\n.c-options-evaluation .tot.rec { border-top-color: var(--ds-highlight-line); border-bottom: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-highlight-line) !important; border-radius: 0 0 calc(0.6cqi * var(--ds-radius-scale, 1)) calc(0.6cqi * var(--ds-radius-scale, 1)); justify-content: center; }\n.c-options-evaluation .tot:not(.rec):not(.lab):not(.wt) { justify-content: center; }",
