   "html": "<section class=\"c-org-chart\" aria-label=\"Target organisation: three levels, new roles highlighted\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"top\">\n      <div class=\"hd\">\n        <p class=\"kicker\">Target organisation</p>\n        <h1>The target organisation adds one executive role and four new units, for 1,980 FTE in total</h1>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"legend\" aria-label=\"Legend\"><li><i class=\"sw is-new\"></i>New role</li><li><i class=\"sw\"></i>Existing role</li><li><span class=\"fte\">FTE</span>Full-time equivalents</li></ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      <div class=\"org\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 880 315\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"ln\" d=\"M503.8 66V92.5M185 92.5H758.8M185 92.5V115M503.8 92.5V115M758.8 92.5V115M185 185V215M57.5 215H312.5M57.5 215V245M185 215V245M312.5 215V245M503.8 185V215M440 215H567.5M440 215V245M567.5 215V245M758.8 185V215M695 215H822.5M695 215V245M822.5 215V245\"/></svg>\n        <div class=\"box l1\" style=\"left:39.88cqi;top:0cqi;width:21cqi;height:6.6cqi\"><b>Chief Executive Officer</b><span class=\"fte\">1,980 FTE</span></div>\n        <div class=\"box l2\" style=\"left:7.50cqi;top:11.5cqi;width:22cqi;height:7cqi\"><b>Chief Operating Officer</b><span class=\"fte\">1,850 FTE</span></div>\n        <div class=\"box l2\" style=\"left:39.38cqi;top:11.5cqi;width:22cqi;height:7cqi\"><b>Chief Financial Officer</b><span class=\"fte\">68 FTE</span></div>\n        <div class=\"box l2 is-new\" style=\"left:64.88cqi;top:11.5cqi;width:22cqi;height:7cqi\"><span class=\"flag\">New</span><b>Chief Commercial Officer</b><span class=\"fte\">62 FTE</span></div>\n        <div class=\"box l3 is-new\" style=\"left:0.00cqi;top:24.5cqi;width:11.5cqi;height:7cqi\"><span class=\"flag\">New</span><b>Hub Network</b><span class=\"fte\">180 FTE</span></div>\n        <div class=\"box l3\" style=\"left:12.75cqi;top:24.5cqi;width:11.5cqi;height:7cqi\"><b>Depot Operations</b><span class=\"fte\">1,150 FTE</span></div>\n        <div class=\"box l3\" style=\"left:25.50cqi;top:24.5cqi;width:11.5cqi;height:7cqi\"><b>Fleet and Linehaul</b><span class=\"fte\">520 FTE</span></div>\n        <div class=\"box l3\" style=\"left:38.25cqi;top:24.5cqi;width:11.5cqi;height:7cqi\"><b>Finance and Planning</b><span class=\"fte\">60 FTE</span></div>\n        <div class=\"box l3 is-new\" style=\"left:51.00cqi;top:24.5cqi;width:11.5cqi;height:7cqi\"><span class=\"flag\">New</span><b>Investment Office</b><span class=\"fte\">8 FTE</span></div>\n        <div class=\"box l3 is-new\" style=\"left:63.75cqi;top:24.5cqi;width:11.5cqi;height:7cqi\"><span class=\"flag\">New</span><b>Key Accounts</b><span class=\"fte\">24 FTE</span></div>\n        <div class=\"box l3 is-new\" style=\"left:76.50cqi;top:24.5cqi;width:11.5cqi;height:7cqi\"><span class=\"flag\">New</span><b>E-commerce</b><span class=\"fte\">38 FTE</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\"><span>Source: Company HR system, September 2026 headcount; target design workshop. Illustrative figures.</span><span class=\"page\">15</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-org-chart {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-org-chart .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n  padding: 5cqi 6cqi 3.2cqi;\n}\n.c-org-chart .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 3cqi; }\n.c-org-chart .kicker { margin: 0; font-size: 1.25cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-org-chart h1 {\n  margin: 1cqi 0 0;\n  max-width: 78cqi;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 2.6cqi;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  text-wrap: balance;\n}\n.c-org-chart .tracker { position: absolute; top: 5cqi; right: 6cqi; display: flex; gap: 0.5cqi; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n.c-org-chart .tracker li {\n  padding: 0.3cqi 0.9cqi;\n  border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill);\n  font-size: 1cqi;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.c-org-chart .tracker li.on { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border-color: var(--ds-highlight-line); color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-org-chart .body { min-height: 0; padding: 2.4cqi 0 2cqi; }\n.c-org-chart .foot {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 3cqi;\n  padding-top: 0.9cqi;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  font-size: 0.95cqi;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n}\n.c-org-chart .page { flex: none; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-org-chart .body { padding-top: 1.8cqi; }\n.c-org-chart .org { position: relative; width: 88cqi; height: 31.5cqi; }\n.c-org-chart .org svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible; }\n.c-org-chart .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--ds-neutral-line); stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-linecap: square; }\n.c-org-chart .box { position: absolute; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.6cqi; padding: 0 0.8cqi; text-align: center; background: var(--ds-raised); border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); border-radius: calc(0.6cqi * var(--ds-radius-scale, 1)); }\n.c-org-chart .box b { font-size: 1.3cqi; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-org-chart .l1 { background: var(--ds-action); border-color: var(--ds-action); }\n.c-org-chart .l1 b { font-size: 1.6cqi; color: var(--ds-on-action); }\n.c-org-chart .l2 b { font-size: 1.4cqi; }\n.c-org-chart .is-new { padding-top: 0.3cqi; }\n.c-org-chart .is-new { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-highlight-line); }\n.c-org-chart .flag { position: absolute; top: -0.85cqi; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); padding: 0.15cqi 0.8cqi; border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill); background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-highlight-line); font-size: 0.95cqi; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-org-chart .fte { padding: 0.2cqi 0.8cqi; border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill); background: var(--ds-neutral-fill); border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-neutral-line); font-size: 1cqi; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.2; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--ds-text); white-space: nowrap; }\n.c-org-chart .l1 .fte { background: transparent; border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-on-action) 50%, transparent); color: var(--ds-on-action); }\n.c-org-chart .legend { position: absolute; top: 5cqi; right: 6cqi; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.8cqi; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; font-size: 1.05cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-org-chart .legend li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6cqi; }\n.c-org-chart .sw { width: 1.5cqi; height: 1.1cqi; border-radius: calc(0.3cqi * var(--ds-radius-scale, 1)); background: var(--ds-raised); border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); }\n.c-org-chart .sw.is-new { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-highlight-line); }",
