   "html": "<section class=\"c-pitch-market\" aria-label=\"Market slide\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"brand\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 3v14M8 3v14M12 3v14M16 3v14\"/><path class=\"strike\" d=\"M1.5 15.5L18.5 4.5\"/></svg>Tallyhouse</div>\n    <div class=\"main\">\n      <h2>Counted from the bottom up, the market is $2.4B.</h2>\n      <div class=\"calc\">\n        <div class=\"term\"><b>2.1M</b><span>studios of 2 to 20 people</span></div>\n        <div class=\"op\">&times;</div>\n        <div class=\"term\"><b>$1,150</b><span>average contract, per year</span></div>\n        <div class=\"op\">=</div>\n        <div class=\"term out\"><b>$2.4B</b><span>a year, across US, UK, EU</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"assume\">\n        <p><b>Assumption 1</b>Counted from business registries, not analyst reports.</p>\n        <p><b>Assumption 2</b>$1,150 is what customers pay today, not a list price.</p>\n        <p><b>Assumption 3</b>A 5% share in year five is about $121M of ARR.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-pitch-market, .c-pitch-market *, .c-pitch-market *::before, .c-pitch-market *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.c-pitch-market {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-pitch-market .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr);\n  padding: 6cqi;\n}\n.c-pitch-market .brand {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.6cqi;\n  font-size: 1.5cqi;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-pitch-market .brand svg { width: 1.7cqi; height: 1.7cqi; fill: none; stroke: var(--ds-ink); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; }\n.c-pitch-market .brand svg .strike { stroke: var(--ds-highlight-line); }\n.c-pitch-market .num {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 6cqi;\n  bottom: 2.6cqi;\n  font-size: 1cqi;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n.c-pitch-market h2 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 4.6cqi;\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1.06;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-pitch-market .kicker { font-size: 1.5cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n\n.c-pitch-market .main { display: grid; align-content: space-between; padding-top: 3cqi; }\n.c-pitch-market h2 { max-width: 70cqi; }\n.c-pitch-market .calc { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr; align-items: stretch; gap: 2cqi; }\n.c-pitch-market .op { align-self: center; }\n.c-pitch-market .term { display: grid; gap: 0.9cqi; padding: 2.2cqi 2.6cqi; align-content: center; border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); border-radius: var(--ds-radius-lg); background: var(--ds-panel); }\n.c-pitch-market .term.out { border-color: var(--ds-info-line); background: var(--ds-info-fill); }\n.c-pitch-market .term b { font-family: var(--ds-font-display); font-size: 6cqi; font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display); letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display); line-height: 1; color: var(--ds-ink); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-pitch-market .term span { font-size: 1.6cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-text); }\n.c-pitch-market .op { font-size: 3.6cqi; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-pitch-market .assume { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 3.2cqi; padding-top: 1.8cqi; border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); }\n.c-pitch-market .assume p { margin: 0; font-size: 1.5cqi; line-height: 1.42; color: var(--ds-text); }\n.c-pitch-market .assume p b { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.4cqi; font-size: 1.3cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-muted); }",
