   "html": "<section class=\"c-pitch-problem\" aria-label=\"Problem slide\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"brand\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 3v14M8 3v14M12 3v14M16 3v14\"/><path class=\"strike\" d=\"M1.5 15.5L18.5 4.5\"/></svg>Tallyhouse</div>\n    <div class=\"main\">\n      <h2>Small studios do their books on nights and weekends.</h2>\n      <div class=\"pains\">\n        <div class=\"pain\"><div class=\"fig\">9<small>hours</small></div><p>every month spent chasing receipts and matching them to bank lines.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"pain\"><div class=\"fig\">31%</div><p>of invoices land more than 30 days late, and nobody has time to chase.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"pain\"><div class=\"fig\">$3,200</div><p>a year in fixes when the accountant finds the mess at year-end.</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-pitch-problem, .c-pitch-problem *, .c-pitch-problem *::before, .c-pitch-problem *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.c-pitch-problem {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-pitch-problem .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr);\n  padding: 6cqi;\n}\n.c-pitch-problem .brand {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.6cqi;\n  font-size: 1.5cqi;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-pitch-problem .brand svg { width: 1.7cqi; height: 1.7cqi; fill: none; stroke: var(--ds-ink); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; }\n.c-pitch-problem .brand svg .strike { stroke: var(--ds-highlight-line); }\n.c-pitch-problem .num {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 6cqi;\n  bottom: 2.6cqi;\n  font-size: 1cqi;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n.c-pitch-problem h2 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 4.6cqi;\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1.06;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-pitch-problem .kicker { font-size: 1.5cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n\n.c-pitch-problem .main { display: grid; align-content: space-between; padding-top: 4cqi; }\n.c-pitch-problem h2 { max-width: 66cqi; }\n.c-pitch-problem .pains { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 3.2cqi; }\n.c-pitch-problem .pain { display: grid; gap: 1.1cqi; align-content: start; padding-top: 1.8cqi; border-top: 0.35cqi solid var(--ds-danger-line); }\n.c-pitch-problem .fig {\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 6.4cqi;\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n.c-pitch-problem .fig small { margin-left: 0.25em; font-size: 0.34em; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-pitch-problem .pain p { margin: 0; max-width: 24cqi; font-size: 1.8cqi; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--ds-text); }",
