   "html": "<section class=\"c-pitch-team\" aria-label=\"Team slide\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"brand\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 3v14M8 3v14M12 3v14M16 3v14\"/><path class=\"strike\" d=\"M1.5 15.5L18.5 4.5\"/></svg>Tallyhouse</div>\n    <div class=\"main\">\n      <h2>We have run the books, and we have built the software.</h2>\n      <div class=\"people\">\n        <div class=\"p\"><div class=\"av\" aria-hidden=\"true\">MV</div><b>Maren Voss</b><span class=\"role\">CEO</span><p>Ran finance operations for a 40-person design agency for six years.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"p\"><div class=\"av\" aria-hidden=\"true\">IO</div><b>Idris Okafor</b><span class=\"role\">CTO</span><p>Built the ledger behind a payments startup that moved $3B.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"p\"><div class=\"av\" aria-hidden=\"true\">PR</div><b>Priya Raman</b><span class=\"role\">Head of Product</span><p>Shipped invoicing used by 200,000 freelancers at Penwick.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"p\"><div class=\"av\" aria-hidden=\"true\">TE</div><b>Tomas Eklund</b><span class=\"role\">Head of Growth</span><p>Grew a creative-tools community from zero to 90,000 members.</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</div>\n</section>",
