   "html": "<section class=\"c-pitch-traction\" aria-label=\"Traction slide\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"brand\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 3v14M8 3v14M12 3v14M16 3v14\"/><path class=\"strike\" d=\"M1.5 15.5L18.5 4.5\"/></svg>Tallyhouse</div>\n    <div class=\"main\">\n      <div class=\"left\">\n        <div class=\"kicker\">Monthly recurring revenue</div>\n        <div class=\"figure\">$84k</div>\n        <div class=\"badge\">+22% a month</div>\n        <p class=\"note\">Six-month average growth, from 880 paying studios.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"plot\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 316\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Line chart of monthly recurring revenue over 18 months, from $1.2k in May 2025 to $84k in October 2026, with milestones at public launch, $10k, bank feeds and $50k.\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n          <line class=\"gl\" x1=\"36\" x2=\"530\" y1=\"280.0\" y2=\"280.0\"/><text class=\"yt\" x=\"28\" y=\"284.0\">0</text><line class=\"gl\" x1=\"36\" x2=\"530\" y1=\"208.9\" y2=\"208.9\"/><text class=\"yt\" x=\"28\" y=\"212.9\">$25k</text><line class=\"gl\" x1=\"36\" x2=\"530\" y1=\"137.8\" y2=\"137.8\"/><text class=\"yt\" x=\"28\" y=\"141.8\">$50k</text><line class=\"gl\" x1=\"36\" x2=\"530\" y1=\"66.7\" y2=\"66.7\"/><text class=\"yt\" x=\"28\" y=\"70.7\">$75k</text>\n          <path class=\"area\" d=\"M36.0,276.6 L65.1,275.4 L94.1,274.0 L123.2,272.0 L152.2,269.8 L181.3,266.6 L210.4,262.6 L239.4,257.2 L268.5,249.8 L297.5,239.6 L326.6,226.0 L355.6,208.9 L384.7,187.6 L413.8,160.5 L442.8,129.2 L471.9,96.5 L500.9,69.5 L530.0,41.1 L530.0,280 L36,280 Z\"/>\n          <path class=\"ln\" d=\"M36.0,276.6 L65.1,275.4 L94.1,274.0 L123.2,272.0 L152.2,269.8 L181.3,266.6 L210.4,262.6 L239.4,257.2 L268.5,249.8 L297.5,239.6 L326.6,226.0 L355.6,208.9 L384.7,187.6 L413.8,160.5 L442.8,129.2 L471.9,96.5 L500.9,69.5 L530.0,41.1\"/>\n          <line class=\"ml\" x1=\"152.2\" x2=\"152.2\" y1=\"263.8\" y2=\"245.8\"/><circle class=\"md\" cx=\"152.2\" cy=\"269.8\" r=\"4.5\"/><text class=\"mt\" x=\"152.2\" y=\"239.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Public launch</text><line class=\"ml\" x1=\"268.5\" x2=\"268.5\" y1=\"243.8\" y2=\"225.8\"/><circle class=\"md\" cx=\"268.5\" cy=\"249.8\" r=\"4.5\"/><text class=\"mt\" x=\"268.5\" y=\"219.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">$10k MRR</text><line class=\"ml\" x1=\"355.6\" x2=\"355.6\" y1=\"202.9\" y2=\"184.9\"/><circle class=\"md\" cx=\"355.6\" cy=\"208.9\" r=\"4.5\"/><text class=\"mt\" x=\"365.6\" y=\"178.9\" text-anchor=\"end\">Bank feeds</text><line class=\"ml\" x1=\"442.8\" x2=\"442.8\" y1=\"123.2\" y2=\"105.2\"/><circle class=\"md\" cx=\"442.8\" cy=\"129.2\" r=\"4.5\"/><text class=\"mt\" x=\"452.8\" y=\"99.2\" text-anchor=\"end\">$50k MRR</text>\n          <circle class=\"end\" cx=\"530.0\" cy=\"41.1\" r=\"7\"/>\n          <text class=\"xt\" x=\"36.0\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"start\">May 25</text><text class=\"xt\" x=\"210.4\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Nov 25</text><text class=\"xt\" x=\"384.7\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\">May 26</text><text class=\"xt\" x=\"530.0\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"end\">Oct 26</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-pitch-traction, .c-pitch-traction *, .c-pitch-traction *::before, .c-pitch-traction *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.c-pitch-traction {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-pitch-traction .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr);\n  padding: 6cqi;\n}\n.c-pitch-traction .brand {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.6cqi;\n  font-size: 1.5cqi;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-pitch-traction .brand svg { width: 1.7cqi; height: 1.7cqi; fill: none; stroke: var(--ds-ink); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; }\n.c-pitch-traction .brand svg .strike { stroke: var(--ds-highlight-line); }\n.c-pitch-traction .num {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 6cqi;\n  bottom: 2.6cqi;\n  font-size: 1cqi;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n.c-pitch-traction h2 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 4.6cqi;\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1.06;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-pitch-traction .kicker { font-size: 1.5cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n\n.c-pitch-traction .main { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 29cqi minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 4cqi; align-items: center; padding-top: 2cqi; }\n.c-pitch-traction .left { display: grid; gap: 1.6cqi; align-content: center; }\n.c-pitch-traction .figure { font-family: var(--ds-font-display); font-size: 12cqi; font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display); letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 0.9; color: var(--ds-ink); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-pitch-traction .badge { justify-self: start; padding: 0.5cqi 1.3cqi; border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-note-line); border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill); background: var(--ds-note-fill); font-size: 1.8cqi; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-pitch-traction .note { margin: 0; font-size: 1.7cqi; line-height: 1.42; color: var(--ds-text); }\n.c-pitch-traction .plot svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }\n.c-pitch-traction .gl { stroke: var(--ds-line); stroke-width: 1; }\n.c-pitch-traction .yt { fill: var(--ds-muted); font-size: 12px; text-anchor: end; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-pitch-traction .xt { fill: var(--ds-muted); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }\n.c-pitch-traction .area { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-info-line) 16%, transparent); }\n.c-pitch-traction .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--ds-info-line); stroke-width: 3.5; stroke-linejoin: round; stroke-linecap: round; }\n.c-pitch-traction .ml { stroke: var(--ds-neutral-line); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 2 3; }\n.c-pitch-traction .md { fill: var(--ds-surface); stroke: var(--ds-ink); stroke-width: 2; }\n.c-pitch-traction .mt { fill: var(--ds-ink); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }\n.c-pitch-traction .end { fill: var(--ds-highlight-line); stroke: var(--ds-surface); stroke-width: 3; }",
