   "html": "<section class=\"c-pitch-why-now\" aria-label=\"Why now slide\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"brand\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 3v14M8 3v14M12 3v14M16 3v14\"/><path class=\"strike\" d=\"M1.5 15.5L18.5 4.5\"/></svg>Tallyhouse</div>\n    <div class=\"main\">\n      <h2>Three shifts make this possible now.</h2>\n      <div class=\"tl\">\n        <div class=\"step\"><div class=\"yr\">2022</div><h3>Bank feeds are standard</h3><p>Every major studio bank now shares transactions, so the data arrives on its own.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"step\"><div class=\"yr\">2024</div><h3>AI learned to read receipts</h3><p>Models read invoices and receipts with accountant-level accuracy, at pennies a page.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"step now\"><div class=\"yr\">2026</div><h3>E-invoicing becomes law</h3><p>Digital invoices are required in more markets, so paper workflows are on their way out.</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-pitch-why-now, .c-pitch-why-now *, .c-pitch-why-now *::before, .c-pitch-why-now *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.c-pitch-why-now {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-pitch-why-now .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr);\n  padding: 6cqi;\n}\n.c-pitch-why-now .brand {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.6cqi;\n  font-size: 1.5cqi;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-pitch-why-now .brand svg { width: 1.7cqi; height: 1.7cqi; fill: none; stroke: var(--ds-ink); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; }\n.c-pitch-why-now .brand svg .strike { stroke: var(--ds-highlight-line); }\n.c-pitch-why-now .num {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 6cqi;\n  bottom: 2.6cqi;\n  font-size: 1cqi;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n.c-pitch-why-now h2 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 4.6cqi;\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1.06;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-pitch-why-now .kicker { font-size: 1.5cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n\n.c-pitch-why-now .main { display: grid; align-content: space-between; padding-top: 4cqi; }\n.c-pitch-why-now h2 { max-width: 60cqi; }\n.c-pitch-why-now .tl { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 4cqi; padding-top: 4cqi; }\n.c-pitch-why-now .tl::before { content: \"\"; position: absolute; top: 0.68cqi; left: 0; right: 0; height: 0.16cqi; background: var(--ds-line); }\n.c-pitch-why-now .step { position: relative; display: grid; gap: 0.9cqi; align-content: start; }\n.c-pitch-why-now .step::before { content: \"\"; position: absolute; top: -4cqi; left: 0; width: 1.5cqi; height: 1.5cqi; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ds-surface); border: 0.3cqi solid var(--ds-neutral-line); }\n.c-pitch-why-now .step.now::before { background: var(--ds-highlight-line); border-color: var(--ds-highlight-line); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.6cqi var(--ds-highlight-fill); }\n.c-pitch-why-now .yr { font-family: var(--ds-font-display); font-size: 3.4cqi; font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display); letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display); line-height: 1; color: var(--ds-ink); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-pitch-why-now .step h3 { margin: 0.4cqi 0 0; font-size: 2cqi; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-pitch-why-now .step p { margin: 0; max-width: 24cqi; font-size: 1.65cqi; line-height: 1.42; color: var(--ds-text); }",
