   "html": "<section class=\"c-quote-slide\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <figure>\n      <div class=\"glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</div>\n      <blockquote>We stopped asking which tool was cheapest and started asking which one our team would still open in six months.</blockquote>\n      <figcaption><b>Head of Operations</b><span>Regional logistics firm, customer interview, September 2026</span></figcaption>\n    </figure>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-quote-slide {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-quote-slide .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  align-content: center;\n  padding: 6cqi 10cqi;\n}\n.c-quote-slide .glyph {\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 16cqi;\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  line-height: 0.6;\n  height: 6.4cqi;\n  color: var(--ds-neutral-line);\n}\n.c-quote-slide blockquote {\n  margin: 0;\n  max-width: 78cqi;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 4.1cqi;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.015em;\n  line-height: 1.22;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-quote-slide figcaption {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 0.4cqi;\n  margin-top: 4cqi;\n  padding-left: 2cqi;\n  border-left: calc(var(--ds-stroke) * 2) solid var(--ds-highlight-line);\n  font-size: 1.7cqi;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n}\n.c-quote-slide figcaption b { font-size: 1.9cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-quote-slide figure { margin: 0; }",
