   "html": "<section class=\"c-raci-matrix\" aria-label=\"RACI matrix for the hub programme\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"top\">\n      <div class=\"hd\">\n        <p class=\"kicker\">Governance</p>\n        <h1>Every activity has exactly one accountable owner, and the COO holds three of the seven</h1>\n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      <div class=\"grid\">\n      <div class=\"th first\">Activity</div><div class=\"th\">CEO</div><div class=\"th\">COO</div><div class=\"th\">CFO</div><div class=\"th\">Head of Network</div><div class=\"th\">Head of Sales</div><div class=\"th\">Head of People</div>\n      <div class=\"act\">Approve the hub investment case</div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-a\">A</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-r\">R</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-c\">C</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-c\">C</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-i\">I</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-i\">I</span></div>\n      <div class=\"act\">Select hub sites and design</div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-i\">I</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-a\">A</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-c\">C</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-r\">R</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-i\">I</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-i\">I</span></div>\n      <div class=\"act\">Procure sortation equipment</div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-i\">I</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-a\">A</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-c\">C</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-r\">R</span></div><div class=\"cell\"></div><div class=\"cell\"></div>\n      <div class=\"act\">Redesign depot routes</div><div class=\"cell\"></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-a\">A</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-i\">I</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-r\">R</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-c\">C</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-i\">I</span></div>\n      <div class=\"act\">Win new retail clients</div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-c\">C</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-c\">C</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-i\">I</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-i\">I</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-a\">A</span><span class=\"p is-r\">R</span></div><div class=\"cell\"></div>\n      <div class=\"act\">Consult the works council</div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-i\">I</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-c\">C</span></div><div class=\"cell\"></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-c\">C</span></div><div class=\"cell\"></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-a\">A</span><span class=\"p is-r\">R</span></div>\n      <div class=\"act\">Track benefits and report monthly</div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-i\">I</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-r\">R</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-a\">A</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-c\">C</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-c\">C</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"p is-i\">I</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"legend\"><li><span class=\"p is-r\">R</span><span><b>Responsible</b>, does the work</span></li><li><span class=\"p is-a\">A</span><span><b>Accountable</b>, owns the outcome</span></li><li><span class=\"p is-c\">C</span><span><b>Consulted</b>, gives input before</span></li><li><span class=\"p is-i\">I</span><span><b>Informed</b>, told after</span></li></ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\"><span>Source: Programme governance charter, draft of October 2026. AR in one cell means the same role is accountable and does the work.</span><span class=\"page\">14</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-raci-matrix {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-raci-matrix .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n  padding: 5cqi 6cqi 3.2cqi;\n}\n.c-raci-matrix .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 3cqi; }\n.c-raci-matrix .kicker { margin: 0; font-size: 1.25cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-raci-matrix h1 {\n  margin: 1cqi 0 0;\n  max-width: 78cqi;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 2.6cqi;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  text-wrap: balance;\n}\n.c-raci-matrix .tracker { position: absolute; top: 5cqi; right: 6cqi; display: flex; gap: 0.5cqi; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n.c-raci-matrix .tracker li {\n  padding: 0.3cqi 0.9cqi;\n  border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill);\n  font-size: 1cqi;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.c-raci-matrix .tracker li.on { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border-color: var(--ds-highlight-line); color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-raci-matrix .body { min-height: 0; padding: 2.4cqi 0 2cqi; }\n.c-raci-matrix .foot {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 3cqi;\n  padding-top: 0.9cqi;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  font-size: 0.95cqi;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n}\n.c-raci-matrix .page { flex: none; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-raci-matrix .body { display: grid; grid-template-rows: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 1.8cqi; }\n.c-raci-matrix .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) repeat(6, 10cqi); grid-template-rows: auto repeat(7, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n.c-raci-matrix .th { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; padding: 0 0.4cqi 1cqi; border-bottom: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-ink); text-align: center; font-size: 1.15cqi; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-raci-matrix .th.first { justify-content: flex-start; padding-left: 0; font-size: 1.1cqi; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n.c-raci-matrix .act, .c-raci-matrix .cell { display: flex; align-items: center; border-bottom: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); }\n.c-raci-matrix .act { font-size: 1.55cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-raci-matrix .cell { justify-content: center; gap: 0.4cqi; }\n.c-raci-matrix .p { display: inline-grid; place-items: center; min-width: 2.6cqi; height: 2.1cqi; padding: 0 0.3cqi; border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-neutral-line); border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill); background: var(--ds-neutral-fill); font-size: 1.2cqi; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-raci-matrix .p.is-r { background: var(--ds-info-fill); border-color: var(--ds-info-line); }\n.c-raci-matrix .p.is-a { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border-color: var(--ds-highlight-line); }\n.c-raci-matrix .p.is-i { background: transparent; border-color: var(--ds-line); color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-raci-matrix .legend { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 3cqi; margin: 0; padding: 1.2cqi 0 0; list-style: none; border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); font-size: 1.2cqi; color: var(--ds-text); }\n.c-raci-matrix .legend li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8cqi; }\n.c-raci-matrix .legend b { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-ink); }",
