   "html": "<section class=\"c-recommendations\" aria-label=\"Four recommendations with impact, effort and timing\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"top\">\n      <div class=\"hd\">\n        <p class=\"kicker\">Recommendation</p>\n        <h1>Four moves deliver the plan, and the two with the highest impact should start first</h1>\n      </div>\n      <ol class=\"tracker\" aria-label=\"Deck sections\"><li>Context</li><li>Options</li><li class=\"on\" aria-current=\"step\">Recommendation</li><li>Next steps</li></ol>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      <div class=\"tbl\">\n      <div class=\"h\"></div><div class=\"h\">Recommendation</div><div class=\"h\">Impact</div><div class=\"h\">Effort</div><div class=\"h\">Timing</div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"n is-first\">1</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c main\"><h2>Build two automated sortation hubs</h2><p>Lifts capacity by 60% and removes overtime</p></div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"pill is-note\">High</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"pill\">High</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"chip\">Q1 2027 to Q4 2028</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"n\">2</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c main\"><h2>Launch next-day delivery in core areas</h2><p>Closes the service gap to the two national rivals</p></div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"pill is-note\">High</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"pill\">Medium</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"chip\">Q2 to Q4 2027</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"n\">3</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c main\"><h2>Diversify the customer base</h2><p>Caps any single client at 15% of volume</p></div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"pill is-info\">Medium</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"pill\">Low</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"chip\">From Q1 2027</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"n\">4</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c main\"><h2>Optimise routes every night</h2><p>Cuts idle mileage and the cost of the last mile</p></div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"pill is-info\">Medium</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"pill\">Low</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c\"><span class=\"chip\">Q1 to Q2 2027</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\"><span>Source: Company strategy workshop and financial model v4, October 2026. Illustrative figures.</span><span class=\"page\">11</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-recommendations {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-recommendations .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n  padding: 5cqi 6cqi 3.2cqi;\n}\n.c-recommendations .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 3cqi; }\n.c-recommendations .kicker { margin: 0; font-size: 1.25cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-recommendations h1 {\n  margin: 1cqi 0 0;\n  max-width: 78cqi;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 2.6cqi;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  text-wrap: balance;\n}\n.c-recommendations .tracker { position: absolute; top: 5cqi; right: 6cqi; display: flex; gap: 0.5cqi; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n.c-recommendations .tracker li {\n  padding: 0.3cqi 0.9cqi;\n  border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill);\n  font-size: 1cqi;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.c-recommendations .tracker li.on { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border-color: var(--ds-highlight-line); color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-recommendations .body { min-height: 0; padding: 2.4cqi 0 2cqi; }\n.c-recommendations .foot {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 3cqi;\n  padding-top: 0.9cqi;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  font-size: 0.95cqi;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n}\n.c-recommendations .page { flex: none; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-recommendations .pill {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5cqi;\n  padding: 0.35cqi 1cqi;\n  border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-neutral-line);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill);\n  background: var(--ds-neutral-fill);\n  font-size: 1.2cqi;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.c-recommendations .pill.is-info { background: var(--ds-info-fill); border-color: var(--ds-info-line); color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-recommendations .pill.is-note { background: var(--ds-note-fill); border-color: var(--ds-note-line); color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-recommendations .pill.is-high { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border-color: var(--ds-highlight-line); color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-recommendations .pill.is-danger { background: var(--ds-danger-fill); border-color: var(--ds-danger-line); color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-recommendations .tbl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 5cqi minmax(0, 1fr) 11cqi 11cqi 18cqi; grid-template-rows: auto repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); height: 100%; }\n.c-recommendations .h { padding: 0 0 1cqi; border-bottom: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-ink); font-size: 1.1cqi; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-recommendations .c { display: flex; align-items: center; border-bottom: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); }\n.c-recommendations .main { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; gap: 0.4cqi; padding-right: 2cqi; }\n.c-recommendations h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.9cqi; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-recommendations .main p { margin: 0; font-size: 1.4cqi; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--ds-text); }\n.c-recommendations .n { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 3.2cqi; height: 3.2cqi; margin-left: 0.2cqi; border-radius: 50%; border: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-ink); font-size: 1.5cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-recommendations .n.is-first { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border-color: var(--ds-highlight-line); }\n.c-recommendations .chip { padding: 0.4cqi 1.1cqi; border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill); background: var(--ds-raised); font-size: 1.2cqi; font-weight: 600; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--ds-text); white-space: nowrap; }",
