   "html": "<section class=\"c-tam-sam-som\" aria-label=\"Slide 10: total, serviceable and obtainable market for regional freight\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"head\">\n      <div class=\"top\">\n        <p class=\"kicker\">Market review · Market size</p>\n        <ul class=\"tracker\" aria-label=\"Where this slide sits in the deck\"><li class=\"is-on\" aria-current=\"step\">Diagnosis</li><li>Options</li><li>Roadmap</li></ul>\n      </div>\n      <h2>The serviceable market is €1.9bn, and a realistic 2029 target of €300m needs only a 16% share of it</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"exhibit\">\n      <div class=\"frame\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 880 315\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Nested circles with area proportional to market size: total addressable market 4.8 billion euros, serviceable market 1.9 billion, obtainable market 300 million.\"><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"155\" r=\"148\" style=\"fill:color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-info-line) 22%, var(--ds-surface));stroke:var(--ds-info-line);stroke-width:1.5\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"209.9\" r=\"93.1\" style=\"fill:color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-info-line) 44%, var(--ds-surface));stroke:var(--ds-info-line);stroke-width:1.5\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"266\" r=\"37\" style=\"fill:color-mix(in srgb, var(--ds-highlight-line) 70%, var(--ds-surface));stroke:var(--ds-highlight-line);stroke-width:2\"/><text class=\"lg b ink mid\" x=\"168\" y=\"33\">€4.8bn</text><text class=\"sm b mu mid\" x=\"168\" y=\"48\">TAM</text><text class=\"lg b ink mid\" x=\"168\" y=\"142.8\">€1.9bn</text><text class=\"sm b mu mid\" x=\"168\" y=\"157.8\">SAM</text><text class=\"md b ink mid\" x=\"168\" y=\"271\">€300m</text><text class=\"sm b mu mid\" x=\"168\" y=\"221\">SOM</text><path d=\"M168 7 H325 V9 H340\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--ds-info-line);stroke-width:1.2;stroke-dasharray:0\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"7\" r=\"3\" style=\"fill:var(--ds-info-line)\"/><path d=\"M168 116.8 H325 V99 H340\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--ds-info-line);stroke-width:1.2;stroke-dasharray:3 3\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"116.8\" r=\"3\" style=\"fill:var(--ds-info-line)\"/><path d=\"M168 229 H325 V189 H340\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--ds-highlight-line);stroke-width:1.2;stroke-dasharray:3 3\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"229\" r=\"3\" style=\"fill:var(--ds-highlight-line)\"/></svg>\n        <div class=\"def\" style=\"left:40%;right:0;top:0%\">\n          <p class=\"nm\"><b>TAM</b> Total addressable market</p>\n          <p class=\"dd\">All regional road freight and parcel spend in the four countries we could enter by 2030.¹</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"def\" style=\"left:40%;right:0;top:28.6%\">\n          <p class=\"nm\"><b>SAM</b> Serviceable addressable market</p>\n          <p class=\"dd\">The part we can serve with today's depots and vehicle types: pallet, parcel and cold chain within 250 km of a depot.²</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"def is-key\" style=\"left:40%;right:0;top:57.1%\">\n          <p class=\"nm\"><b>SOM</b> Serviceable obtainable market</p>\n          <p class=\"dd\">What we can realistically win by 2029, a 16% share of SAM, limited by depot capacity and sales hiring.³</p>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"notes\"><span>1. Statistics for road freight and parcels in four countries, grown at 3.1% a year to 2029.</span><span>2. Excludes bulk, air and cross-border freight; assumes no new depots before 2028.</span><span>3. A 16% share equals our share today in markets where we have operated for five years.</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\">\n      <span>Source: national freight statistics 2025; company model. Illustrative figures. Circle areas are proportional to value.</span>\n      <span class=\"page\">10</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-tam-sam-som {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-tam-sam-som .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n  row-gap: 1.4cqi;\n  padding: 5cqi 6cqi;\n}\n.c-tam-sam-som .top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2cqi; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .kicker { margin: 0; font-size: 1.25cqi; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-tam-sam-som .tracker { display: flex; gap: 0.5cqi; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .tracker li { padding: 0.3cqi 0.9cqi; border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill); background: var(--ds-panel); font-size: 1cqi; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-tam-sam-som .tracker li.is-on { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ds-highlight-line); color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-tam-sam-som h2 {\n  margin: 0.9cqi 0 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 2.6cqi;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  text-wrap: balance;\n}\n.c-tam-sam-som .exhibit { min-height: 0; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .frame { position: relative; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 880 / 315; }\n.c-tam-sam-som svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible; }\n.c-tam-sam-som svg text { font-family: var(--ds-font-sans); fill: var(--ds-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .grid { stroke: var(--ds-line); stroke-width: 1; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .axis { stroke: var(--ds-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .tick { fill: var(--ds-muted); font-size: 12px; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .sm { font-size: 12px; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .md { font-size: 13px; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .lg { font-size: 14px; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .b { font-weight: 700; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .sb { font-weight: 600; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .ink { fill: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-tam-sam-som .mu { fill: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-tam-sam-som .mid { text-anchor: middle; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .end { text-anchor: end; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .halo { paint-order: stroke; stroke: var(--ds-surface); stroke-width: 4px; stroke-linejoin: round; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .foot {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 3cqi;\n  padding-top: 0.9cqi;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  font-size: 0.95cqi;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n}\n.c-tam-sam-som .page { flex: none; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n\n.c-tam-sam-som .def { position: absolute; padding-right: 1cqi; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .nm { margin: 0; font-size: 1.1cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-tam-sam-som .nm b { margin-right: 0.5cqi; font-size: 1.1cqi; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ds-ink); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .dd { margin: 0.4cqi 0 0; font-size: 1.3cqi; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--ds-text); max-width: 46cqi; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .def.is-key .dd { color: var(--ds-ink); font-weight: 600; }\n.c-tam-sam-som .notes { position: absolute; left: 40%; right: 0; bottom: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0.8cqi 0 0; border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); font-size: 0.95cqi; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-tam-sam-som .notes span { display: block; }",
