   "html": "<section class=\"c-tracker-and-appendix\" aria-label=\"Appendix: investment by line item and year\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"top\">\n      <div class=\"hd\">\n        <p class=\"kicker\">Appendix</p>\n        <h1>Backup: the EUR 85m investment is weighted to 2027, when 49% is spent</h1>\n      </div>\n      <ol class=\"tracker\" aria-label=\"Deck sections\"><li>Context</li><li>Options</li><li>Recommendation</li><li class=\"on\" aria-current=\"step\">Appendix</li></ol>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      <div class=\"tbl\">\n      <div class=\"h lab\">Line item, EUR m</div><div class=\"h\">2027</div><div class=\"h\">2028</div><div class=\"h\">2029</div><div class=\"h\">Total</div><div class=\"h\">Share</div><div class=\"h b\"><span>Basis<sup>3</sup></span></div>\n      <div class=\"c lab\"><span>Automated hub one (north)</span></div><div class=\"c n\">24</div><div class=\"c n\">4</div><div class=\"c n\">0</div><div class=\"c n t\">28</div><div class=\"c n\">33%</div><div class=\"c\">Quote</div>\n      <div class=\"c lab\"><span>Automated hub two (south)</span></div><div class=\"c n\">6</div><div class=\"c n\">22</div><div class=\"c n\">2</div><div class=\"c n t\">30</div><div class=\"c n\">35%</div><div class=\"c\">Benchmark</div>\n      <div class=\"c lab\"><span>Depot refresh, six sites<sup>1</sup></span></div><div class=\"c n\">8</div><div class=\"c n\">6</div><div class=\"c n\">3</div><div class=\"c n t\">17</div><div class=\"c n\">20%</div><div class=\"c\">Benchmark</div>\n      <div class=\"c lab\"><span>Fleet electrification<sup>2</sup></span></div><div class=\"c n\">2</div><div class=\"c n\">3</div><div class=\"c n\">2</div><div class=\"c n t\">7</div><div class=\"c n\">8%</div><div class=\"c\">Quote</div>\n      <div class=\"c lab\"><span>Systems and route optimisation</span></div><div class=\"c n\">2</div><div class=\"c n\">1</div><div class=\"c n\">0</div><div class=\"c n t\">3</div><div class=\"c n\">4%</div><div class=\"c\">Estimate</div>\n      <div class=\"c lab tr\">Total</div><div class=\"c n tr\">42</div><div class=\"c n tr\">36</div><div class=\"c n tr\">7</div><div class=\"c n tr\">85</div><div class=\"c n tr\">100%</div><div class=\"c tr\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"notes\">\n        <li><b>1</b>The six depots with the highest 2026 parcel volume.</li>\n        <li><b>2</b>Covers 140 electric vans; the rest of the fleet stays leased.</li>\n        <li><b>3</b>Quote is a signed supplier quote, benchmark a recent comparable project, estimate an internal engineering view.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\"><span>Source: Company investment plan, October 2026. Figures rounded; shares may not add to 100%. Illustrative figures.</span><span class=\"page\">24</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-tracker-and-appendix {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n  padding: 5cqi 6cqi 3.2cqi;\n}\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 3cqi; }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .kicker { margin: 0; font-size: 1.25cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix h1 {\n  margin: 1cqi 0 0;\n  max-width: 78cqi;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 2.6cqi;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  text-wrap: balance;\n}\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .tracker { position: absolute; top: 5cqi; right: 6cqi; display: flex; gap: 0.5cqi; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .tracker li {\n  padding: 0.3cqi 0.9cqi;\n  border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill);\n  font-size: 1cqi;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .tracker li.on { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); border-color: var(--ds-highlight-line); color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .body { min-height: 0; padding: 2.4cqi 0 2cqi; }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .foot {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 3cqi;\n  padding-top: 0.9cqi;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  font-size: 0.95cqi;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n}\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .page { flex: none; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .body { display: grid; grid-template-rows: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 1.6cqi; }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .tbl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) repeat(5, 9.5cqi) 13cqi; grid-template-rows: auto repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .h { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: flex-end; padding: 0 0 0.9cqi; border-bottom: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-ink); font-size: 1.1cqi; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .h.lab { justify-content: flex-start; }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .h.b { justify-content: flex-start; padding-left: 2cqi; }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .c { display: flex; align-items: center; border-bottom: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); font-size: 1.45cqi; }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .c.lab { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .c.n { justify-content: flex-end; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .c.t { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .c:nth-child(7n) { padding-left: 2cqi; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .tr { font-weight: 800; color: var(--ds-ink) !important; border-top: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-ink); border-bottom: 0 !important; background: var(--ds-panel); }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix sup { font-size: 0.65em; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-muted); margin-left: 0.2em; }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .notes { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 0.3cqi; font-size: 1cqi; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-tracker-and-appendix .notes b { color: var(--ds-text); font-weight: 700; margin-right: 0.5em; }",
