   "html": "<section class=\"c-waterfall-bridge\" aria-label=\"Slide 5: EBIT bridge from FY2025 to FY2026\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"head\">\n      <div class=\"top\">\n        <p class=\"kicker\">Financial review · EBIT bridge</p>\n      </div>\n      <h2>EBIT rose €1.3m to €19.7m: volume, price and efficiency added €8.5m, but fuel, wages and a depot one-off took back €7.2m</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"exhibit\">\n      <div class=\"frame\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 880 315\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"EBIT bridge in million euros. FY2025 18.4, volume growth plus 4.1, price and mix plus 2.6, network efficiency plus 1.8, fuel minus 3.2, driver wages minus 2.9, depot one-off minus 1.1, FY2026 19.7.\"><text class=\"md b ink\" x=\"0\" y=\"14\">EBIT bridge, FY2025 to FY2026, €m</text><line class=\"axis\" x1=\"50\" x2=\"880\" y1=\"248\" y2=\"248\"/><text class=\"tick end\" x=\"42\" y=\"252\">0</text><line class=\"grid\" x1=\"50\" x2=\"880\" y1=\"185.3\" y2=\"185.3\"/><text class=\"tick end\" x=\"42\" y=\"189.3\">10</text><line class=\"grid\" x1=\"50\" x2=\"880\" y1=\"122.7\" y2=\"122.7\"/><text class=\"tick end\" x=\"42\" y=\"126.7\">20</text><line class=\"grid\" x1=\"50\" x2=\"880\" y1=\"60\" y2=\"60\"/><text class=\"tick end\" x=\"42\" y=\"64\">30</text><rect x=\"69.9\" y=\"132.7\" width=\"64\" height=\"115.3\" rx=\"2\" style=\"fill:var(--ds-neutral-line)\"/><text class=\"lg b ink mid\" x=\"101.9\" y=\"125.7\">18.4</text><text class=\"md b ink mid\" x=\"101.9\" y=\"268\">FY2025</text><rect x=\"173.6\" y=\"107\" width=\"64\" height=\"25.7\" rx=\"2\" style=\"fill:var(--ds-note-line)\"/><text class=\"lg b ink mid\" x=\"205.6\" y=\"100\">+4.1</text><text class=\"md sb mid\" x=\"205.6\" y=\"268\">Volume</text><text class=\"md sb mid\" x=\"205.6\" y=\"283\">growth</text><rect x=\"277.4\" y=\"90.7\" width=\"64\" height=\"16.3\" rx=\"2\" style=\"fill:var(--ds-note-line)\"/><text class=\"lg b ink mid\" x=\"309.4\" y=\"83.7\">+2.6</text><text class=\"md b ink mid\" x=\"309.4\" y=\"268\">Price and mix</text><rect x=\"381.1\" y=\"79.4\" width=\"64\" height=\"11.3\" rx=\"2\" style=\"fill:var(--ds-note-line)\"/><text class=\"lg b ink mid\" x=\"413.1\" y=\"72.4\">+1.8</text><text class=\"md sb mid\" x=\"413.1\" y=\"268\">Network</text><text class=\"md sb mid\" x=\"413.1\" y=\"283\">efficiency</text><rect x=\"484.9\" y=\"79.4\" width=\"64\" height=\"20.1\" rx=\"2\" style=\"fill:var(--ds-danger-line)\"/><text class=\"lg b ink mid\" x=\"516.9\" y=\"72.4\">−3.2</text><text class=\"md b ink mid\" x=\"516.9\" y=\"268\">Fuel</text><rect x=\"588.6\" y=\"99.5\" width=\"64\" height=\"18.2\" rx=\"2\" style=\"fill:var(--ds-danger-line)\"/><text class=\"lg b ink mid\" x=\"620.6\" y=\"92.5\">−2.9</text><text class=\"md sb mid\" x=\"620.6\" y=\"268\">Driver</text><text class=\"md sb mid\" x=\"620.6\" y=\"283\">wages</text><rect x=\"692.4\" y=\"117.7\" width=\"64\" height=\"6.9\" rx=\"2\" style=\"fill:var(--ds-danger-line)\"/><text class=\"lg b ink mid\" x=\"724.4\" y=\"110.7\">−1.1</text><text class=\"md sb mid\" x=\"724.4\" y=\"268\">Depot</text><text class=\"md sb mid\" x=\"724.4\" y=\"283\">one-off</text><rect x=\"796.1\" y=\"124.5\" width=\"64\" height=\"123.5\" rx=\"2\" style=\"fill:var(--ds-neutral-line)\"/><text class=\"lg b ink mid\" x=\"828.1\" y=\"117.5\">19.7</text><text class=\"md b ink mid\" x=\"828.1\" y=\"268\">FY2026</text><text class=\"sm mu mid\" x=\"828.1\" y=\"283\">+7% on FY2025</text><line x1=\"133.9\" x2=\"173.6\" y1=\"132.7\" y2=\"132.7\" style=\"stroke:var(--ds-neutral-line);stroke-width:1;stroke-dasharray:3 3\"/><line x1=\"237.6\" x2=\"277.4\" y1=\"107\" y2=\"107\" style=\"stroke:var(--ds-neutral-line);stroke-width:1;stroke-dasharray:3 3\"/><line x1=\"341.4\" x2=\"381.1\" y1=\"90.7\" y2=\"90.7\" style=\"stroke:var(--ds-neutral-line);stroke-width:1;stroke-dasharray:3 3\"/><line x1=\"445.1\" x2=\"484.9\" y1=\"79.4\" y2=\"79.4\" style=\"stroke:var(--ds-neutral-line);stroke-width:1;stroke-dasharray:3 3\"/><line x1=\"548.9\" x2=\"588.6\" y1=\"99.5\" y2=\"99.5\" style=\"stroke:var(--ds-neutral-line);stroke-width:1;stroke-dasharray:3 3\"/><line x1=\"652.6\" x2=\"692.4\" y1=\"117.7\" y2=\"117.7\" style=\"stroke:var(--ds-neutral-line);stroke-width:1;stroke-dasharray:3 3\"/><line x1=\"756.4\" x2=\"796.1\" y1=\"124.5\" y2=\"124.5\" style=\"stroke:var(--ds-neutral-line);stroke-width:1;stroke-dasharray:3 3\"/><path d=\"M173.6 47 V40 H445.1 V47\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--ds-note-line);stroke-width:1.5\"/><text class=\"md b ink mid\" x=\"309.4\" y=\"33\">Gains: +€8.5m</text><path d=\"M484.9 47 V40 H756.4 V47\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--ds-danger-line);stroke-width:1.5\"/><text class=\"md b ink mid\" x=\"620.6\" y=\"33\">Cost pressure: −€7.2m</text></svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\">\n      <span>Source: management accounts FY2025 and FY2026 (to September, annualised). Illustrative figures.</span>\n      <span class=\"page\">5</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-waterfall-bridge {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-waterfall-bridge .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n  row-gap: 1.4cqi;\n  padding: 5cqi 6cqi;\n}\n.c-waterfall-bridge .top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2cqi; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .kicker { margin: 0; font-size: 1.25cqi; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .tracker { display: flex; gap: 0.5cqi; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .tracker li { padding: 0.3cqi 0.9cqi; border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill); background: var(--ds-panel); font-size: 1cqi; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .tracker li.is-on { background: var(--ds-highlight-fill); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ds-highlight-line); color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-waterfall-bridge h2 {\n  margin: 0.9cqi 0 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 2.6cqi;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  text-wrap: balance;\n}\n.c-waterfall-bridge .exhibit { min-height: 0; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .frame { position: relative; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 880 / 315; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge svg text { font-family: var(--ds-font-sans); fill: var(--ds-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .grid { stroke: var(--ds-line); stroke-width: 1; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .axis { stroke: var(--ds-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .tick { fill: var(--ds-muted); font-size: 12px; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .sm { font-size: 12px; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .md { font-size: 13px; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .lg { font-size: 14px; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .b { font-weight: 700; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .sb { font-weight: 600; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .ink { fill: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .mu { fill: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .mid { text-anchor: middle; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .end { text-anchor: end; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .halo { paint-order: stroke; stroke: var(--ds-surface); stroke-width: 4px; stroke-linejoin: round; }\n.c-waterfall-bridge .foot {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 3cqi;\n  padding-top: 0.9cqi;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  font-size: 0.95cqi;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n}\n.c-waterfall-bridge .page { flex: none; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }",
