   "id": "motion/message-stack",
   "slug": "message-stack",
   "category": "motion",
   "title": "Message stack",
   "description": "Chat messages arrive one at a time, each preceded by a typing indicator, and the thread scrolls up as it grows. A timed reveal, not a static thread.",
