   "html": "<article class=\"c-carousel-cover\" aria-label=\"Carousel cover slide\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"top\">\n      <span class=\"tag\">Small business tools</span>\n      <span class=\"count\">01<span>/07</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"main\">\n      <h1>Stop paying for <span class=\"hl\">five apps<svg class=\"ul\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 12\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 7 C 16 3, 30 10, 48 6 S 78 3, 98 7\"/></svg></span> that do one job.</h1>\n      <p class=\"sub\">Seven tools that replaced my whole admin stack, and what each one costs.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bottom\">\n      <span class=\"handle\">@yourhandle</span>\n      <span class=\"swipe\">Swipe <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M1 6h17M13 1l5 5-5 5\"/></svg></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>",
   "css": ".c-carousel-cover {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: min(540px, 100%);\n  aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n  box-shadow: var(--ds-shadow-md);\n}\n.c-carousel-cover .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;\n  padding: 8cqi;\n}\n.c-carousel-cover .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }\n.c-carousel-cover .tag {\n  padding: 1.4cqi 3cqi;\n  border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill);\n  font-size: 3.2cqi;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  background: var(--ds-raised);\n}\n.c-carousel-cover .count { font-size: 3.4cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-ink); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-carousel-cover .count span { color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-carousel-cover .main { align-self: center; display: grid; gap: 5cqi; }\n.c-carousel-cover h1 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 11.6cqi;\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1.04;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  text-wrap: balance;\n}\n.c-carousel-cover .hl { position: relative; display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap; }\n.c-carousel-cover .ul {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: -1.5%;\n  bottom: -1.8cqi;\n  width: 103%;\n  height: 3cqi;\n  max-width: none;\n  overflow: visible;\n  fill: none;\n  stroke: var(--ds-highlight-line);\n  stroke-width: 1.1cqi;\n  stroke-linecap: round;\n  stroke-linejoin: round;\n  vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;\n}\n.c-carousel-cover .ul path { vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }\n.c-carousel-cover .sub { margin: 0; max-width: 78%; font-size: 4.4cqi; line-height: 1.4; }\n.c-carousel-cover .bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }\n.c-carousel-cover .handle { font-size: 3.4cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-carousel-cover .swipe {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 2cqi;\n  padding: 2cqi 3.6cqi;\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill);\n  background: var(--ds-action);\n  color: var(--ds-on-action);\n  font-size: 3.6cqi;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n.c-carousel-cover .swipe svg { width: 5cqi; height: 3cqi; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 0.5cqi; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }",
