   "html": "<article class=\"c-stat-post\" aria-label=\"Stat post\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"eyebrow\">Admin, by the numbers</div>\n    <div class=\"main\">\n      <div class=\"num-wrap\">\n        <p class=\"num\">73<small>%</small></p>\n        <svg class=\"ul\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 12\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 8 C 20 3, 34 11, 54 6 S 84 4, 98 7\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"context\">of small teams still keep their client list in a spreadsheet nobody owns.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\">\n      <span><b>Source:</b> Example Research, survey of 1,200 small-business owners, 2026</span>\n      <span class=\"handle\">@yourhandle</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>",
   "css": ".c-stat-post {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: min(540px, 100%);\n  aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n  box-shadow: var(--ds-shadow-md);\n}\n.c-stat-post .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;\n  padding: 8cqi;\n}\n.c-stat-post .eyebrow { font-size: 3.4cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-stat-post .main { align-self: center; display: grid; gap: 6cqi; }\n.c-stat-post .num-wrap { position: relative; justify-self: start; padding-bottom: 3cqi; }\n.c-stat-post .num {\n  display: block;\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 44cqi;\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: -0.04em;\n  line-height: 0.9;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n.c-stat-post .num small { font-size: 0.55em; letter-spacing: 0; margin-left: 0.02em; }\n.c-stat-post .ul {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 0;\n  bottom: -1cqi;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 5cqi;\n  max-width: none;\n  overflow: visible;\n  fill: none;\n  stroke: var(--ds-highlight-line);\n  stroke-width: 1.7cqi;\n  stroke-linecap: round;\n}\n.c-stat-post .ul path { vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }\n.c-stat-post .context { margin: 0; max-width: 100%; font-size: 6cqi; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-ink); text-wrap: balance; }\n.c-stat-post .foot { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 4cqi; padding-top: 3.2cqi; border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line); font-size: 3cqi; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-stat-post .foot b { color: var(--ds-text); font-weight: 600; }\n.c-stat-post .foot .handle { white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-text); }",
