   "html": "<article class=\"c-tool-card-slide\" aria-label=\"Tool recommendation slide\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"top\">\n      <span class=\"tag\">Tool of the week</span>\n      <span class=\"count\">03<span>/07</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"head\">\n      <h2>tidyup</h2>\n      <span class=\"repo\">github.com/example/tidyup</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stage\">\n      <div class=\"stamp\">Worth it</div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <p class=\"what\">Renames and sorts a messy downloads folder in one command.</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M1.5 6.5l3 3 6-7\"/></svg><span>Previews every change first</span></li>\n          <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M1.5 6.5l3 3 6-7\"/></svg><span>Undo the last run with one flag</span></li>\n          <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M1.5 6.5l3 3 6-7\"/></svg><span>Rules live in one plain-text file</span></li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"facts\">\n          <span>&#9733; 12.4k</span><span class=\"sep\">&middot;</span>\n          <span>640 forks</span><span class=\"sep\">&middot;</span>\n          <span class=\"circled\">2.1 MB<svg class=\"circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 40\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 22 C 8 8, 40 3, 68 5 C 94 7, 99 27, 70 35 C 44 41, 6 38, 4 24 C 3 13, 22 6, 38 5\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"scribble\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 20\"><path d=\"M20 18 C 10 18, 4 12, 4 3 M1 7 L4 2 L8 6\"/></svg>\n            tiny install!\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"chrome\"><span>Free and open source</span><span>@yourhandle</span></div>\n  </div>\n</article>",
   "css": ".c-tool-card-slide {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: min(540px, 100%);\n  aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n  box-shadow: var(--ds-shadow-md);\n}\n.c-tool-card-slide .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr auto;\n  padding: 8cqi;\n}\n.c-tool-card-slide .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }\n.c-tool-card-slide .tag { font-size: 3.2cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-tool-card-slide .count { font-size: 3.4cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-ink); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-tool-card-slide .count span { color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-tool-card-slide .head { display: grid; gap: 2.6cqi; justify-items: start; margin-top: 5cqi; }\n.c-tool-card-slide h2 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 11.4cqi;\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-tool-card-slide .repo {\n  padding: 1.2cqi 3cqi;\n  border: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-pill);\n  background: var(--ds-raised);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-mono);\n  font-size: 3cqi;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n}\n.c-tool-card-slide .stage { position: relative; align-self: center; margin-top: 4cqi; }\n.c-tool-card-slide .card {\n  padding: 5cqi 5cqi 9cqi;\n  border: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-neutral-line);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-lg);\n  background: var(--ds-raised);\n}\n.c-tool-card-slide .what { margin: 0; max-width: 94%; font-size: 4.7cqi; line-height: 1.28; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-ink); text-wrap: balance; }\n.c-tool-card-slide ul { list-style: none; margin: 3.6cqi 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 2cqi; }\n.c-tool-card-slide li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3.6cqi 1fr; gap: 2.6cqi; align-items: start; font-size: 3.5cqi; line-height: 1.3; }\n.c-tool-card-slide li svg { width: 3.6cqi; height: 3.6cqi; margin-top: 0.3cqi; fill: none; stroke: var(--ds-note-line); stroke-width: 0.7cqi; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }\n.c-tool-card-slide .facts {\n  position: relative;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 1.6cqi 3cqi;\n  margin-top: 4.4cqi;\n  padding-top: 3.6cqi;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-mono);\n  font-size: 3.1cqi;\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n}\n.c-tool-card-slide .sep { color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-tool-card-slide .circled { position: relative; display: inline-block; padding: 0 1.4cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-tool-card-slide .circle {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: -2.4cqi;\n  top: -2.6cqi;\n  width: calc(100% + 4.8cqi);\n  height: calc(100% + 5.2cqi);\n  max-width: none;\n  overflow: visible;\n  fill: none;\n  stroke: var(--ds-highlight-line);\n  stroke-width: 0.8cqi;\n  stroke-linecap: round;\n  stroke-linejoin: round;\n}\n.c-tool-card-slide .circle path { vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }\n.c-tool-card-slide .scribble {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 1cqi;\n  top: calc(100% + 1.4cqi);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 1.2cqi;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-hand);\n  font-size: 4.6cqi;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  transform: rotate(-3deg);\n}\n.c-tool-card-slide .scribble svg { width: 6cqi; height: 5cqi; margin-top: -3.4cqi; fill: none; stroke: var(--ds-highlight-line); stroke-width: 0.6cqi; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }\n.c-tool-card-slide .scribble svg path { vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }\n.c-tool-card-slide .stamp {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -4.6cqi;\n  right: -1.4cqi;\n  transform: rotate(-7deg);\n  padding: 1.6cqi 3.6cqi;\n  border: 0.7cqi solid var(--ds-note-line);\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius-sm);\n  background: var(--ds-note-fill);\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  font-size: 4.2cqi;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n.c-tool-card-slide .chrome { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 3cqi; font-size: 3cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }",
